        <div class="col-sm-12">
          <div class="title-container">
            <img src="https://individualogist.com/soul-flame-tarot/assets/img/title-bg-v2.png" alt="Snow" style="width:100%;" class="long-title">
            <h3 class="centered">As A <span class="archetype">Explorer</span>, These Are Your <span class="text-orange">Hidden Qualities, Unknown Tendencies,<br>And Positive Attributes</span> That You Wouldn't Expect</h3>
          </div>
          <div class="row">
            <div class="col-sm-4">
              <img src="../assets/images/abilities.png" style="width: 100%;">
            </div>
            <div class="col-sm-8">
              <p>The introvert within you is strong, on account of you having a freedom-loving personality. You want to see the world in its entirety, and as such you would rather be an observer of experiences, patiently blending in with the environment and just watching as things develop from a safe distance.</p>
              <p>Thus, this makes you quite perceptive in your ability to figure things out in a short span of time. You do not require so much help-- you simply <span class="text-orange">feel the vibe</span>-- and you are right.</p>
              <p>Moreover, your personality is likewise centered around a collective sense of unity. In your opinion, people aren’t just objects you encounter along the way or tools you eventually come across to help solve any problems you have in life. They are better than that, and you will likewise treat them with such care and diligence.</p>
              <p>Aside from this, you are also quite moralistic, preferring to act upon the most just ends while at the same time still satisfying the curious adventurer within.</p>

            </div>
          </div>
          <p>As an explorer, you are <span class="text-orange">ruled by your intuitive nature</span>. You allow your mind to wander, and you likewise do not rely on the rigid conformities that logic expects on you. As it implies, you are a free soul with an equally free motive, and you are unafraid to show that before the world.</p>
          <p>Likewise, however, this can leave room for disorderly behavior. Since you forgo structure in your daily life, you can be quite chaotic in your affairs, which can be detrimental in the wrong cases.</p>
          <p>Finally, another thing that you excel at is being calm and steady about your approach to things. Rarely if ever do you allow yourself to lose hope, and even if you do, it is only for the briefest of moments before you are able to assert control again. This strength of mind makes you a <span class="text-orange">powerful decision-maker</span>.</p>
          <p>If nothing else, it also aids in your ability to understand the world even further. Explorers need a calm mind to see the world in their own way, and you will not fail to do so cleanly.</p>
          <p>That being said, there’s more about your potential than you understand at this juncture, <span class="username"></span>. </p>
          <p>With your hidden qualities in full view, it is time for you to know what your strengths are and how you can better use them...</p>
